      "camera_calibration": {
        "score": 1.0,
        "tier": "intrinsics_extrinsics_validated",
        "notes": "Per-session calibration.json: pinhole model with radial-tangential distortion (k1, k2, p1, p2, k3) per camera plus stereo rotation/translation (42 mm baseline), from an 8x6 chessboard with 30 mm squares at 1280x720 following Zhang (2000). Validation: reprojection error below 0.03 px per camera; mean per-pixel epipolar error after rectification 0.4 px across all 13 devices; visual-inertial residual sync offset 700 us checked with Kalibr's cam-IMU offset test. Source: arXiv:2608.08285 + HuggingFace card.",
